  "strengths": [
    "Scans and aggregates billions of rows per second per node",
    "Excellent compression (often 10x+) with per-column codecs",
    "Incremental materialized views and TTLs make rollups and retention cheap",
    "Ingests millions of rows per second, including directly from Kafka",
    "Runs anywhere: single binary, self-managed cluster or ClickHouse Cloud",
    "Huge function library and integrations with S3, Iceberg, Delta and Postgres"
